                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-08-08"><hi rendition="#italic">August 8,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Rockhill reports delay to signing of the final protocol caused by objections
                    raised by British Government against the international commission for the
                    revision of tariff, which was unanimously accepted June 11, and the Chinese
                    Government so informed; also by wanting to insert in the protocol a clause
                    highly objectionable to several of the powers.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
